      "message": "feat(ui): G-code window - selectable text, highlighted trace line, click a line to trace\n\nCode is selectable and copyable without the gutter numbers, the cursor\nrow has a background band, a click on a row moves the cursor there, and\nthe trace view no longer blows the window up to thousands of pixels\n(Sides replaced by fixed rects). Viewer moved from pages.rs to\ngcode_view.rs.\n\nFixes #1089\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
